8192 MB (raised previously in #issue) still hits V8's heap limit once all ~44 locales carry full translated content and \`vitepress-plugin-llms\` walks every rendered page (client + SSR passes). Raising to 14336 MB leaves headroom under the 16 GB \`ubuntu-latest\` runner ceiling.

This is a one-time cost for the first full-locale seed described in the PR — incremental deploys after this touch far fewer pages and should need much less memory."", "explanation": "Open a PR for the fix", "goal": "Create pull request for the docs deploy fix", "mode": "sync"}

